+<p>
+<cx "vowels, pronunciation of (quick-tour version)">  XE "vowels: pronunci=
ation of, quick-tour version"   Lojban has six recognized vowels: =93a=94, =
=93e=94, =93i=94, =93o=94, =93u=94 and =93y=94. The first five are roughly =
pronounced as =93a=94 as in =93father=94, =93e=94 as in =93let=94, =93i=94 =
as in =93machine=94, =93o=94 as in =93dome=94 and =93u=94 as in =93flute=94=
. =93y=94 is pronounced as the sound called =93schwa=94, that is, as the un=
stressed =93a=94 as in =93about=94 or =93around=94.
