pronunciation of, quick-tour version"   The Lojban diphthongs =93ai=94, =93=
ei=94, =93oi=94, and =93au=94 are pronounced much as in the English words =
=93sigh=94, =93say=94, =93boy=94, and =93how=94. Other Lojban diphthongs be=
