rt (which is taken to be basic). See <a href=3Dchap5.html>Chapter 5</a>.
+</dl><cx "selma'o, definition (quick-tour version)">  XE "selma'o: definit=
ion, quick-tour version"   <dl compact><dt>selma'o:  <dd>a group of cmavo t=
hat have the same grammatical use (can appear interchangeably in sentences,=
