+</pre><p>The consonant =93x=94 has no voiced counterpart in Lojban. The re=
maining consonants, =93l=94, =93m=94, =93n=94, and =93r=94, are typically p=
ronounced with voice, but can be pronounced unvoiced.
+<p>
