+<p>
+<a name=3Ds11><h3>The lujvo-making algorithm</h3>
+<p>
+<cx "lujvo, algorithm for">  XE "lujvo: algorithm for"   The following is =
the current algorithm for generating Lojban lujvo given a known tanru and a=
