tion">  XE "seltau: definition"   This change is called =93tanru inversion=
=94. In tanru inversion, the element before =93co=94 (=93zdani=94 in <a hre=
f=3D#e8d2>Example 8.2</a>) is the tertau, and the element following =93co=
=94 (=93blanu=94) in <a href=3D#e8d2>Example 8.2</a>) is the seltau.
