+<a name=3Ds11><h3>The syntax of vocative phrases</h3>
+<p>
+<cx "vocative phrases, as a =93free modifier=94">  XE "vocative phrase: as=
 a free modifier"   Vocative phrases are not sumti, but are explained in th=
