: implicit quantifiers on"   <cx "vocative phrase, explicit quantifiers pro=
hibited on">  XE "vocative phrase: explicit quantifiers prohibited on"   Th=
e listener need not really be a =93xunre pastu nixli=94, as long as she und=
erstands herself correctly from the description. (Actually, only a bare sel=
bri can appear; explicit quantifiers are forbidden in this form of vocative=
, so the implicit quantifiers =93su'o le ro=94 are in effect.)
