+<cx "names, uses of">  XE "names: uses of"   <cx "names, in vocative phras=
e">  XE "names: in vocative phrase"   <cx "names, with LA descriptor">  XE =
"names: with LA descriptor"   Names of this kind have two basic uses in Loj=
ban: when used in a vocative phrase (see <a href=3D#s11>Section 11</a>) the=
y indicate who the listener is or should be. When used with a descriptor of=
