+	The Joneses go to the store.
+</pre><p>In <a href=3D#e12d2>Example 12.2</a>, the significance is that al=
l the persons (perhaps only one) I mean to refer to by the name =93djonz.=
=94 are going to the store. In <a href=3D#e12d3>Example 12.3</a>, the Jones=
es are massified, and only some part of them needs to be going. Of course, =
by =93djonz.=94 I can mean whomever I want: that person need not use the na=
