+<a name=3Ds13><h3>Pro-sumti summary</h3>
+<p>
+<cx "pro-sumti, classes of">  XE "pro-sumti: classes of"   The Lojban pro-=
sumti are the cmavo of selma'o KOhA. They fall into several classes: person=
