+<a name=3Ds1><h3>What are you pointing at?</h3>
+<p>
+The following cmavo are discussed in this section:
+<p>
+<pre> 	poi	NOI	restrictive relative clause introducer
+	ke'a	GOhA	relative pro-sumti
