if it is somewhat further away, or =93tu=94 if it is distant. (Pro-sumti ar=
e explained in full in <a href=3Dchap7.html>Chapter 7</a>.)
+<p>
+<cx "reference, ambiguity of ti/ta/tu">  XE "reference: ambiguity of ti/ta=
/tu"   However, even with the assistance of a pointing finger, or pointing =
lips, or whatever may be appropriate in the local culture, it is often hard=
