+<a name=3Ds20><h3>Logical and non-logical connections between tenses</h3>
+<p>
+Like many things in Lojban, tenses may be logically connected; logical con=
nection is explained in more detail in <a href=3Dchap14.html>Chapter 14</a>=
. Some of the terminology in this section will be clear only if you already=
