ught logical connections"   <cx "tenses, possible groupings of">  XE =93ten=
se: possible groupings of"   There are no forethought logical connections b=
etween tenses allowed by the grammar, to keep tenses simpler. Nor is there =
any way to override simple left-grouping of the connectives, the Lojban def=
ault.
