 mu=94, which the cmavo =93la'u=94 (of selma'o BAI, and meaning =93with qua=
ntity=94; see <a href=3Dchap9.html>Chapter 9</a>) marks as a quantity. Both=
 terms are governed by the tag =93zu'a=94.
+<p>
