n"   <cx "le nu, definition">  XE "le nu: definition"   The examples in <a =
href=3D#s1>Section 1 </a>made use of =93nu=94 as the abstractor, and it is =
certainly the most common abstractor in Lojban text. Its purpose is to capt=
