+<a name=3Ds3><h3>The meaning of lujvo</h3>
+<p>
+This is a fairly long way to go to try and work out how to say =93doghouse=
=94! The reader can take heart; we're nearly there. Recall that one of the =
components involved in fixing the meaning of a tanru =97 the one left delib=
