  <cx "sheep breed">  XE "sheep breed"   <cx "lujvo place order, non-overla=
pping place structures">  XE "lujvo place order: non-overlapping place stru=
ctures"   <cx "lujvo place order, complex relation">  XE "lujvo place order=
: complex relation"   Another example of this kind of anomalous lujvo, draw=
