refers to a dog which controls sheep flocks, a =93terlanme jitro gerku=94, =
the lujvo from which is =93terlantroge'u=94 with place structure:
+<p>
+  XE "sheep flock: example"  <pre><a name=3De14d5>14.5)	g1=3Dj1 is a dog t=
hat controls sheep flock l3=3Dj2 made up of sheep l1=20
