useful insights into a possible theory of emotion (which might be testable =
using Lojban), and incidentally explains how Lojbanists express compound em=
otions when they do recognize them.
+<p>
+<cx "attitudinal scale, neutral compared with positive + negative">  XE "a=
ttitudinal scale: neutral compared with positive + negative"   The existenc=
