ing =93I'm awed=94 is not the same as saying =93Wow!!!=94. The Lojban syste=
m is intended to give the effects of an analytical system without the thoug=
ht involved. Thus, you can simply feel in Lojban.
+<p>
+<cx "attitudinals, design benefit">  XE "attitudinals: design benefit"   A=
 nice feature of this design is that you can be simple or complex, and the =
system works the same way. The most immediate benefit is in learning. You o=
