+<a name=3Ds6><h3>Emotional categories</h3>
+<p>
+<cx "emotional categories">  XE "emotional categories"   <cx "attitudinal =
categories">  XE "attitudinal categories"   <cx "attitudinal categories, ra=
tionale">  XE "attitudinal categories: rationale"   The Lojban attitudinal =
system was designed by starting with a long list of English emotion words, =
far too many to fit into the 39 available VV-form cmavo. To keep the number=
