t can be combined, like tanru, to express very complex emotions. Some examp=
les in a moment.
+<p>
+The most significant =93common feature=94 we identified was that the emoti=
onal words on the list could easily be broken down into six major groups, e=
ach of which was assigned its own cmavo:
