hy: example=93  <cx "attitudinals, attributing emotion to others">  XE "att=
itudinals: attributing emotion to others"   <cx "attitudes, empathy contras=
ted with sympathy">  XE "attitudes: empathy contrasted with sympathy"   <lx=
