+<cx "lerfu, contrasted with lerfu word">  XE "lerfu: contrasted with lerfu=
 word"   <cx "lerfu word, contrasted with lerfu">  XE "lerfu word: contrast=
ed with lerfu"   <cx "letter, contrasted with word for the letter">  XE "le=
tter: contrasted with word for the letter"   In earlier writings about Lojb=
