+</pre><cx "subscripting, and sumti re-ordering">  XE =93subscripts: and su=
mti re-ordering"   <cx "SE, after 5th place">  XE "SE selma=92o: after 5th =
place"   <cx "FA, after 5th place">  XE "FA selma=92o: after 5th place"   <=
lx "se">  XE "se"   <lx "SE">  XE "SE selma=92o"   <a href=3D#e6d4>Example =
6.4 </a>shows that =93nunkla=94 has six places: the five places of =93klama=
=94 plus a new one (placed first) for the event itself. Performing transfor=
