cx "erasure, multiple word">  XE "erasure: multiple word"   As the above ex=
amples plainly show, precise erasures with =93si=94 can be extremely hard t=
o get right. Therefore, the cmavo =93sa=94 (of selma'o SA) is provided for =
erasing more than one word. The cmavo following =93sa=94 should be the star=
