+<p>
+<pre><a name=3De13d7>13.7)	mi viska le sa  .i mi cusku zo .djan.
+	I see the=A0<dots>=85 </dots>I say the-word =93John=94.
+</pre><p>Since the word following =93sa=94 is =93.i=94, the sentence separ=
ator, its effect is to erase the preceding sentence. So <a href=3D#e13d7>Ex=
ample 13.7 </a>is equivalent to:
+<p>
+<pre><a name=3De13d8>13.8)	mi cusku zo .djan.
+</pre><p>Another example, erasing a partial description rather than a part=
