+<p>
+In this step, the strings must be labelled with the appropriate lexer toke=
ns. Order of inserting lexer tokens IS significant, since some shorter stri=
ngs that would be marked with a lexer token may be found inside longer stri=
ngs. If the tokens are inserted before or in place of the shorter strings, =
the longer strings cannot be identified.
+<p>
+If option a. is chosen, the following order of insertion works correctly (=
it is not the only possible order): A, C, D, B, U, E, H, I, J, K, M, N, G, =
